=== The author's own work ==================================================

  * All source code in this repository.
  * The Warcraft III custom map this game is ported from — its design, systems,
    triggers and balance — and the content derived from it (champions,
    abilities, items, strings, stats).
  * The character models, textures and reskins authored for that map.
  * The 21 Chinese voice quips recorded for the map.
  * All eleven background-music tracks, synthesised from scratch by
    tools/bgm-gen — every waveform computed from numpy arrays, no sample and no
    audio file read as input.
  * The arena ground textures and cursor art, generated procedurally by this
    repo's own scripts — byte-reproducible from a seed.


=== Third-party components =================================================

  * CC0 art — models and textures from KayKit (Kay Lousberg), Quaternius,
    Kenney Vleugels and mastjie. Public domain; credited in
    content/assets/CREDITS.md out of courtesy.

  * CC BY 4.0 — the login-screen dragon,
    content/assets/models/menu/dragon2.glb. Attribution required:

      "Animated Dragon Three Motion Loops"
      (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/animated-dragon-three-motion-loops-eca98cf6cd084c1596cecf716e110c29)
      by LasquetiSpice (https://sketchfab.com/LasquetiSpice)
      licensed under CC-BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)

  * 効果音ラボ (Sound Effect Lab), https://soundeffect-lab.info/ — 40 clips under
    content/assets/audio/sfx/lab/ and audio/voice-jp/. Free to use, credit
    optional, copyright retained by 効果音ラボ. Not CC0.

  * Character names, titles and likenesses in the roster belong to their
    respective rights holders.

content/assets/CREDITS.md holds the full provenance record; docs/asset-debt.md
tracks the local-only Warcraft III development overlay, which is excluded from
version control by .gitignore.
